THE BAIN SAKINA KE HAME KOUN BACHEYE BABA NAHI AYE,<br>
 RANJ-O-ALAM-O-GHAM KE HAR EK SIMT HAIN SAYE BABA NAHI AYE<br>
<br>
QASIM HAIN NA AKBAR HAI NA ABBAS SE DILAWAR HAR SU HAI SITAMGAR,<br>
 AB QAIDE MUSIBAT SE HAME KOUN CHUDAYE BABA NAHI AYE<br>
<br>
DAM GHUT TA HAI MERA ZEHRILEE HAWA MEIN ZINDAAN-E-BALA MEIN,<br>
 DUSHMAN KO BHI IS QAID SE ALLAH BACCHAYE BABA NAHI AYE<br>
<br>
KYON MARTA HAI SHUMR-E-LAYEEN MUJHKO TAMACHE RUQSAR HAIN NEELE,<br>
 KOI MERE ABBAS CHAHCHA KO TOH BULAYE BABA NAHI AYE<br>
<br>
IMDAD KARO POTI KI YA HYDER-E-KARRAR MARTI HAI DILAFGAR,<br>
 KOI YE QABAR JAKE NAJAF MEIN TOH SUNADE BABA NAHI AYE<br>
<br>
HAR WAQT WATAN JANE KI HAI MUJHKO TAMANNA PHIR DEKHU MADINA,<br>
 ZINDA JO MUJHE QAID SE ALLAH CHUDAYE BABA NAHI AYE<br>
<br>
IS TARHA KE JINE SE TOH MARJANA HAI BEHTAR HAR SAANS HAI NASHTAR,<br>
 ZINDAAN MEIN KOI AKE MERI QABAR BANAYE BABA NAHI AYE..